        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>\n> <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, HelveticaNeue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4px;\">Or is it only meant to be used with normal attacks? If so, is the benefit of it that it technically hits a bit harder than a Grenade Launcher would to a single target?\n</span></p><p><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Open Sans, HelveticaNeue, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.4px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">It&#39;s a mistake (we&#39;re compiling errata to release later) and should be an Action. It hits a single target harder than Grenade Launcher and doesn&#39;t backfire like Grenade Launcher can (for example, it&#39;s safer to fire in a populated area, like in certain fights in Megalopolis...)</span></font></p>",
